  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NAMA-Investing in Solar PV-UNDP-GMB-00110747</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project focusing in grid connected renewable energy solutions for rural Gambia. The NAMA Project is geared supporting the Government of the Gambia to meet it Nationally Determine Contributions. In so doing, the project will address one of the fundamental development needs of The Gambia particularly in the rural areas, by providing access to renewable energy to at least 144,500 people in Farafenni and Basse. The project will also provide capacity building opportunities to the National Stakeholder</narrative>
  </description>
